end note

note as REC_CONCURRENCY_SCHED_diagram_41_scheduling
  ANTI-DOUBLE-BOOKING (see module 33 Integrity Matrix)
  bookable_slots.remaining_capacity is decremented under SELECT ... FOR UPDATE.
  A slot_hold reserves capacity with hold_token + expires_at (TTL from booking_policy);
  an idempotent worker releases expired holds (SKIP LOCKED). Confirming a booking
  converts a live hold; UNIQUE(bookable_slot_id, patient_profile_id) on active bookings
  prevents duplicates. resource_ref is polymorphic — constrain via value_set.
end note


